<!doctype html>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>STAGE-167 正式终端角色动画验收</title>
<style>
body{background:#17191d;color:#ddd;font:15px system-ui;margin:20px}
header{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
button,select{background:#292d35;color:#eee;padding:7px;border:1px solid #555;border-radius:4px}
.viewport{overflow:auto;margin-top:16px;contain:content}
canvas{display:block;background:#0c0c0c;border:1px solid #444;max-width:100%;height:auto}
input{width:280px}p{color:#aaa}
</style>
<header><b>STAGE-167 · 正式终端角色动画</b>
<select id="scene" aria-label="验收场景"></select>
<button id="play">播放</button><button id="again">重播</button>
<label><input id="seek" aria-label="帧进度" type="range" min="0" value="0"></label>
<span id="time"></span></header>
<p>正式 Rust 客户端逐帧输出。默认暂停；点击播放观看一遍，拖动进度逐帧检查。切到其他页面会自动暂停。</p>
<div class="viewport"><canvas id="screen" role="img" aria-label="正式终端战斗画面"></canvas></div>
<script id="frames" type="application/json">__FRAMES__</script>
<script>__PLAYER__</script>
